    "title": "Infant safe after ceiling collapses in Pleasant Prairie apartment - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mia Bearden ,\n9 hours ago PLEASANT PRAIRIE, Wis. (CBS 58) - What sounds like a parent’s worst nightmare ended with relief Wednesday afternoon. First responders were called to a home on 39th Ave. after reports that a ceiling had collapsed, with an infant possibly trapped underneath. Officials confirmed the 11-month-old baby is okay. CBS... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
